Audio Duration: 2m 9.9s (129.85s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 07:42:25 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 人是没有感情
Segment #2   [00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,020] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果你觉得人有感情
Segment #3   [00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:02,880] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就会死得很惨
Segment #4   [00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:05,300] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 13 | Text: 大多数人到此都没看明白这个东西
Segment #5   [00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:05,800] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 3  | Text: 很简单
Segment #6   [00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,400] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 就一句话
Segment #7   [00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,620] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 小心每一个活着的人
Segment #8   [00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:08,840] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为只要他是个动物
Segment #9   [00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:09,840] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 是个人形生物
Segment #10  [00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,040] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 7  | Text: 他就一定是逐利的
Segment #11  [00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,440] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 这是事实也是规律
Segment #12  [00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,700] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 就算他是你的父亲
Segment #13  [00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,540] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 他是你的母亲
Segment #14  [00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,780] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 在你没有嫁给的时候
Segment #15  [00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:16,640] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 挣不到钱的时候
Segment #16  [00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,440] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 你管他要钱
Segment #17  [00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,500] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 一样没有好脸色
Segment #18  [00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,780] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 人活着一辈子
Segment #19  [00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:20,500] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 除了你自己
Segment #20  [00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,400] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 不管是你的父母
Segment #21  [00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,000] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 3  | Text: 还是你的孩子
Segment #22  [00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,800] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 全都是拖累
Segment #23  [00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,160] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 1  | Text: 真的
Segment #24  [00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,280] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 你一定要早一点
Segment #25  [00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,040] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 8  | Text: 学会自己跟自己过日子
Segment #26  [00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:27,280] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 8  | Text: 当你不再对任何人
Segment #27  [00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,140] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 抱有期待的时候
Segment #28  [00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,000] | Elapsed:  16.94s | Words: 3  | Text: 你就自由了
Segment #29  [00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,680] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 8  | Text: 当你不再替代爱情
Segment #30  [00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:31,780] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 5  | Text: 亲情友情的时候
Segment #31  [00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:32,820] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就活出来了
Segment #32  [00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,020] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为不管他是谁
Segment #33  [00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,300] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 7  | Text: 一切外在的干扰
Segment #34  [00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,820] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 8  | Text: 都是来证明自己价值的
Segment #35  [00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,620] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 在这个世界上
Segment #36  [00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,080] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 10 | Text: 对一个人唯一的衡量标准
Segment #37  [00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,180] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是价值两个字
Segment #38  [00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,360] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 人没有好坏
Segment #39  [00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:43,200] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 11 | Text: 一个坏人遇到一个有利可图的人
Segment #40  [00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,040] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 5  | Text: 他会变得很好
Segment #41  [00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,840] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 9  | Text: 一个好人带着一个投入评
Segment #42  [00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:46,860] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 也会失去耐心
Segment #43  [00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:48,220] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 9  | Text: 没有所谓的好人和坏人
Segment #44  [00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:48,820] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 也没有对错
Segment #45  [00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,060] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 只有利益跟价值
Segment #46  [00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,100] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 价值是那个天平
Segment #47  [00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,120] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 利益是你的筹码
Segment #48  [00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:52,640] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 利益到位
Segment #49  [00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:53,600] | Elapsed:  36.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 仇人也是朋友
Segment #50  [00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,880] | Elapsed:  36.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 相反利益不到位
Segment #51  [00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:55,800] | Elapsed:  36.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 亲人就是仇人
Segment #52  [00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,640] | Elapsed:  55.50s | Words: 9  | Text: 而每一个想要接近你的人
Segment #53  [00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,520] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 10 | Text: 都是在试图引导你掠夺你
Segment #54  [00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,720] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 这是每一个人
Segment #55  [00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:01,700] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 每一个动物的本能
Segment #56  [00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,960] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 他在掠夺你的价值
Segment #57  [00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,140] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 他在侵略你的人格
Segment #58  [00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:05,180] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为没有人希望
Segment #59  [00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:06,540] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 别人比自己过得好
Segment #60  [00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:08,140] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 9  | Text: 也没有人希望你比他强大
Segment #61  [00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:10,220] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 12 | Text: 更没有人愿意看着你比他成功
Segment #62  [00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,420] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 所有人都是这样的
Segment #63  [00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:12,420] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 包括你也是这样的
Segment #64  [00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:12,960] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 3  | Text: 这是人性
Segment #65  [00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:14,300] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是你在客观的社会里
Segment #66  [00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:15,960] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 你能看到的都是反着的
Segment #67  [00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,740] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 3  | Text: 都是假的
Segment #68  [00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:17,880] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为人需要伪装
Segment #69  [00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:19,240] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 人需要真善美
Segment #70  [00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:20,820] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 10 | Text: 他需要装成皮着羊皮的狼
Segment #71  [00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:22,460] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 那些看起来很好的人
Segment #72  [00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:23,960] | Elapsed:  55.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 坏起来的时候更坏
Segment #73  [00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,780] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 11 | Text: 因为人只能做到短暂的真诚
Segment #74  [00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:26,720] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 和短暂的善良
Segment #75  [00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,980] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 为什么他会对你好
Segment #76  [00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:29,020] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为你还有价值
Segment #77  [00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,600] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为你还有利益可以榨取
Segment #78  [00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,060] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 当你没有利益的时候
Segment #79  [00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:33,320] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 他会跑得比谁都快
Segment #80  [00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:34,860] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为利益是短暂的
Segment #81  [00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:36,240] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以他对你的真诚和善良
Segment #82  [00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,000] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 也是短暂的
Segment #83  [00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:37,720] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 2  | Text: 你知道为什么
Segment #84  [00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,340] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 10 | Text: 你会觉得坏人少好人多吗
Segment #85  [00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:40,480] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为你蠢和因为你笨
Segment #86  [00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,620] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 你不知道谁在害你
Segment #87  [00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:42,400] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 谁在算你
Segment #88  [00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,960] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 你失去了最基本判断力
Segment #89  [00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,660] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 这就是你穷的根本原因
Segment #90  [00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:47,420] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不知道他是好是坏
Segment #91  [00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:48,220] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 你分不清楚
Segment #92  [00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:49,600] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 只要一个人对着笑脸
Segment #93  [00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:50,660] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就觉得是好人
Segment #94  [00:01:50,660 --> 00:01:51,740] | Elapsed:  75.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 只要一个人不理你
Segment #95  [00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:52,860] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就觉得他是坏人
Segment #96  [00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:53,920] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 这是智商问题
Segment #97  [00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,780] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 这是脑子问题
Segment #98  [00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,320] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为你没有基本的判断力
Segment #99  [00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,400] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为你不懂人性
Segment #100 [00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,460] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 人性是什么
Segment #101 [00:01:58,460 --> 00:02:00,440] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 是价值是利益是追逐名利
Segment #102 [00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,500] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就记住了
Segment #103 [00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:03,280] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 这个世界上唯一的评判标准
Segment #104 [00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,680] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是你的价值跟利益
Segment #105 [00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,720] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 千万不要做那个
Segment #106 [00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,620] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 被别人掠夺价值的烂好人
Segment #107 [00:02:07,620 --> 00:02:08,740] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #108 [00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:09,720] | Elapsed:  89.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
